<stringmatch name="armfloatreturn #1: a raw image states no calling convention, so both passes return the zero low word of 1.5" min="2" max="2">unsigned int raw_fixed\(void\)</stringmatch>
<stringmatch name="armfloatreturn #2: an explicit double prototype on the raw image and the on pass return 1.5" min="2" max="2">return 1\.5;</stringmatch>
